{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">During the Vietnam War the United States Air Force discovered that their pilots\u2019 survival rates improved significantly once they completed their first ten combat missions. In 1975 Tactical Air Command created a highly realistic training exercise to provide the aircrews those first 10 missions in peace time. They called it: Red Flag.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This mock battle in the skies over the Nevada Test and Training Range has produced aviators that can not only survive the dangers of modern air combat, but dominate the skies. In the next 2 weeks you\u2019re gonna find out just how real it can get.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join the 336th TFS on their detachment to Red Flag 81-2 at Nellis Air Force Base. Through 13 meticulously researched missions you\u2019ll learn what it was like to fly an F-4E Phantom in this ultimate war game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">13 true to life missions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Randomized scenarios for replayability</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Study level simulation of real life procedures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Thousands of custom voice overs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dozens of historically accurate custom skins</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Detailed briefings with chalkboard diagrams</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Extensive documentation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Authentic kneeboard and briefing images</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Custom DCS UI backgrounds and music</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Localization:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Voiceovers: English</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Briefings/Subtitles: English</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>All required products</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">DCS: F-4E Phantom II by Heatblur Simulations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">DCS: Nevada Test and Training Range</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3594290?t=1744915389","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3594290?t=1744915389","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594290/3a21a70e098d3ca8e34d837be680ac657d1ccb27/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744915389","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594290/3a21a70e098d3ca8e34d837be680ac657d1ccb27/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744915389","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Tracked Controller Support","id":52},{"description":"VR Support","id":31},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">During the Vietnam War the United States Air Force discovered that their pilots\u2019 survival rates improved significantly once they completed their first ten combat missions. In 1975 Tactical Air Command created a highly realistic training exercise to provide the aircrews those first 10 missions in peace time. They called it: Red Flag.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This mock battle in the skies over the Nevada Test and Training Range has produced aviators that can not only survive the dangers of modern air combat, but dominate the skies. In the next 2 weeks you\u2019re gonna find out just how real it can get.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join the 336th TFS on their detachment to Red Flag 81-2 at Nellis Air Force Base. Through 13 meticulously researched missions you\u2019ll learn what it was like to fly an F-4E Phantom in this ultimate war game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">13 true to life missions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Randomized scenarios for replayability</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Study level simulation of real life procedures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Thousands of custom voice overs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dozens of historically accurate custom skins</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Detailed briefings with chalkboard diagrams</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Extensive documentation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Authentic kneeboard and briefing images</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Custom DCS UI backgrounds and music</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Localization:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Voiceovers: English</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Briefings/Subtitles: English</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>All required products</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">DCS: F-4E Phantom II by Heatblur Simulations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">DCS: Nevada Test and Training Range</p></li></ul>","developers":["Eagle Dynamics SA","Reflected Simulations"],"fullgame":{"appid":"223750","name":"DCS World Steam Edition"},"genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594290/a8391b4690e4afeb37def1524d4394e4edf99b7d/header.jpg?t=1744915389","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 Eagle Dynamics SA<br />\r\n\u00a9 Reflected Simulations","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"DCS: F-4E Red Flag 81-2 Campaign by Reflected Simulations","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option_description":"","option_text":"DCS: F-4E Red Fl